[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7863.669, "timestamp": "02:11:03", "text": "你已经失去过一次了，再也找不回来了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7866.79, "timestamp": "02:11:06", "text": "。 我的意思是，我真的把它弄丢了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7870.79, "timestamp": "02:11:10", "text": "说实话，我觉得我在公开场合失去了那份东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7873.669, "timestamp": "02:11:13", "text": "。 我觉得我失去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7876.31, "timestamp": "02:11:16", "text": "它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7879.669, "timestamp": "02:11:19", "text": "因为发生在我身上的一些事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7883.51, "timestamp": "02:11:23", "text": "呃，我不知道。 我现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7886.229, "timestamp": "02:11:26", "text": "不在乎了。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7888.629, "timestamp": "02:11:28", "text": "，到了这个地步，我不在乎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7893.03, "timestamp": "02:11:33", "text": "人们是否仍然那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7895.99, "timestamp": "02:11:35", "text": "看待这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7900.31, "timestamp": "02:11:40", "text": "唉，事情就是这样。 但是，嗯，我内心深处"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7904.229, "timestamp": "02:11:44", "text": "知道，是的，嗯，我内心深处"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7906.149, "timestamp": "02:11:46", "text": "知道我不是那样的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7909.589, "timestamp": "02:11:49", "text": "。 人们可以改变所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7912.629, "timestamp": "02:11:52", "text": "事情，对吧？   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7914.47, "timestamp": "02:11:54", "text": "。"}]